From: Norman Herms <dockseed@proton.me>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 08:27:09 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: input: allwinner,sun4i-a10-lradc-keys: Add the
 A733 compatible

The A733 LRADC has a 6-bit conversion for inputs up to 1.35 V from a
1.8 V supply, a bus gate and a reset, and the register layout of the
R329 LRADC (A733 manual, 18.13.1, 18.13.8, 4.1.6.177). Add
"allwinner,sun60i-a733-lradc" with "allwinner,sun50i-r329-lradc" as the
fallback, so the existing driver binds without a change. The fallback
selects the 3/4 divider of the supply voltage, which gives the 1.35 V
reference of the manual, and its clock and reset are required by the
schema, as the A733 has both.

Not covered: the second ADC channel in the register model; the A733
brings out only LRADC0-0.

Tested on Radxa Cubie A7S: not tested; the board has no key on the
LRADC input.

Assisted-by: LLM
